      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Enola’s historic one‑room schoolhouse, still standing on Shady Lane, dates back to the town’s early days and is a rare example of 19th‑century rural education.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        8
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
